{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally's Health and Lifestyle Column"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Getting Fit!"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Someone's Feelings and Reactions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You talk about feelings and reactions using adjectives.<br/><br/>Adjectives that end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span> are used to describe how a person feels, like <span class =\"italic\">disappointed, interested, fascinating, surprised, bored, worried</span> or <span class =\"italic\">tired</span>.<br/><br/>Adjectives that end in <span class=\"strong\">-ing</span> are used to describe things and situations, like <span class =\"italic\">disappointing, fascinated, distracting, distressing, boring, worrying</span> or <span class =\"italic\">tiring</span>.  <br/>These adjectives describe the effect something has on a person."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Which articles did you find less interesting?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I guess that article was a little disappointing for me. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm not very fascinated by that topic."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Conditional Sentences"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the first conditional to talk about real possibilities in the present or the future. In that condition, something else may or will (not) happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The first conditional contains two clauses: the <span class =\"italic\">If</span> (or <span class =\"italic\">when</span>) clause and the <span class =\"italic\">Condition</span> clause."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The two clauses are interchangeable in terms of their position in a sentence. When the <span class =\"italic\">If</span> or <span class =\"italic\">When</span> clause comes at the beginning of the sentence, you must use a comma after it. When it comes at the end of a sentence, no comma is necessary. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1st Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2nd Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If I meet someone who is in pain,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I could tell them about acupuncture.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible I meet someone who is in pain.  <br> <br> In this condition: I could tell them about acupuncture.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would love to read more on personality \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"if you have the opportunity to write another article.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible you have the opportunity to write another article.  <br> <br>In this condition: I would love to read more on personality. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If I meet someone who is in pain, I could tell them about acupuncture."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I would love to read more on personality if you have the opportunity to write another article. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "caffeinated"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "containing caffeine, like coffee, tea or soda"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I never drink caffeinated drinks before going to bed."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob11aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words to review."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "beverage"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "drink"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What beve